OL,3,GNEWSA'Heroic' girl, 3, to switch on
OL,4,AChristmas lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "inspirational" three-year-old girl
OL,7,Freceiving palliative cancer care has
OL,8,Fbeen chosen to switch on her town's
OL,9,FChristmas lights.
OL,11,FLilith, from Kettering in
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, has neuroblastoma, a
OL,13,Frare cancer that affects nerve cells in
OL,14,Fyoung children.
OL,16,FShe was selected to turn on the town's
OL,17,FChristmas lights on 26 November after
OL,18,Fbeing nominated by members of the
OL,19,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
