OL,3,GNEWSA'Heroic' girl, 3, to switch on
OL,4,AChristmas lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FLilith's mother, Ivy-Rose, described
OL,7,Fher as a "shining light of hope",
OL,8,Fadding that her daughter had shown
OL,9,F"strength and bravery" throughout her
OL,10,Fillness.
